{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0223_1000_p", "source_sha256": "809148f7cd9fe825f616f67391cda1efee7e79b0794b3c1516e4205797045944", "ja": "（今日は新曲のPV撮影。\nもちろん、合唱団の子ども達も一緒だ）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄新曲的PV。\n当然，合唱团的孩子们也会一起来。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0223_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "3a5fe516deb0c317de6adcb3078f91a17adccf3e85225cf930da78915bc3f01e", "ja": "ふんふ、ふふふふふ～……えへっ♪", "zh": "哼哼，呼呼呼呼呼～……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0223_1002_p", "source_sha256": "cd17ad6c285993b03f178dfa9a38d22ffe0e3f5687f4fc566615162eab46d041", "ja": "お疲れ様、真。\nどうしたんだ？　機嫌がよさそうだけど……。", "zh": "辛苦了，真。\n怎么了？看起来心情不错嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0223_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "dd7a53d6a9041d35edae32225274407c0bed82b19de3a1e409e1bbd2d7b139c6", "ja": "あっ。聞いてくださいよ、{$P$}！\nさっき、合唱団のみんなが見学してたじゃないですか？", "zh": "啊，请听我说，{$P$}！  \n刚才合唱团的大家不是来参观了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0223_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "717005ff80d1bd389975a8856f409b4a2ad37dc93298c4f6b1996e3af0bfe768", "ja": "撮影はライブと違って、時間が掛かりますよね。\nイメージどおりにできるまで、何度も撮り直すし……。", "zh": "拍摄和演唱会不一样，会花不少时间，对吧。\n要反复重拍很多次，直到达到预想的效果……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0223_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "9ff9009728992ee6b282d785b7d10c14f1f57de539120a57a28f0f2f5e41f5df", "ja": "だからみんな、退屈してないかなって\n気になってたんですけど。", "zh": "所以我刚才一直在想，大家会不会觉得无聊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0223_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4fee0fd9d495a99456619b57364ecda8e6e233abcebb8d9a35bec99e7d9c7de2", "ja": "みんな、夢中になって見てたな。", "zh": "大家看得很入迷呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0223_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "a947513c976c89f580132f9baf9471c77f3fd8cbb579a36177b2316e8a85fb5b", "ja": "それだけじゃないんですよ！　ボク達が、\n同じシーンを何度もやり直すのを見て……。", "zh": "不只是这样哦！他们看到我们把同一个场景反复重演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0223_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "7bd6a724afc90441e0c6171b44771c3567841d78e36932d3e498182f28aaa6a3", "ja": "「アイドルはすごいね」って、言ってくれたんです！", "zh": "还夸我们说“当偶像真了不起”呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0223_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "65c6fafcb1aba062c567906f68a8c05c2a5cd59ad2a7adda76521995ceb34ed5", "ja": "たったひとつのシーンを撮るために、\nこんなにもたくさん、繰り返すんだ……って。", "zh": "为了拍摄仅仅一个场景，竟然要这样反复这么多次……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0223_1010_p", "source_sha256": "06694af8934854ce48e561465f1cfa05aad1e64e276d801a192ea18e7dfcbb81", "ja": "「アイドルはすごいね」、か。\nうん、最高の褒め言葉じゃないか？", "zh": "“当偶像真了不起啊”，是吗。\n嗯，这不就是最高的赞赏吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0223_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "af40fbd6f2da8052cbf5045a9e517f3b49aa7d40c84e61af914decd737fe8b1d", "ja": "はい！　ボク、ステージじゃなく、撮影でそんなふうに\n言ってもらえるなんて思わなかったから、嬉しくて。", "zh": "是！我没想到自己不是在舞台上，而是在拍摄时也能被这样夸，真的好开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0223_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "7b9a728193286995e0e342576f84d68fb13bf7a74c1461761bd5089c1866a28f", "ja": "みんな、「真お姉ちゃんたちに負けないよう、\nコーラス頑張るね」だって。へへっ♪", "zh": "大家都说“为了不输给真姐姐她们，\n我们会努力唱好和声的哦”。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0223_1013_p", "source_sha256": "67a165580a160f68f62b1e2b276c481484c0f17cd0448b79f3187191c9402a1d", "ja": "そうか。真達の、「一番いいものを届けたい」っていう\n気持ちが、みんなにも伝わったんだと思うよ。", "zh": "这样啊。我想，真她们那份“想把最好的东西送到大家手中”的心情，也传达给大家了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0223_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "f541ba75af1d1d87b489c01385cf8ceb9686987e9271418e352b83bef9dd2c70", "ja": "そうなんですかね？\nだったら嬉しいな～、へへ……。", "zh": "是这样吗？\n如果真是那样，我会很开心的～嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0223_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "2769a299a28eb4b08bf0cabc2c163024a7536f9b313797b3bb95947d2ee81112", "ja": "それに、せっかくみんなと仲良くなれたのに、\nツアーでしか会えないのは寂しいなって思ってたから。", "zh": "而且，好不容易和大家熟悉起来了，却只能在巡演时见面，我一直觉得挺寂寞的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0223_1016_p", "source_sha256": "002b788e693673febc3abd48881866895eb91cfcfb207fe9411c4cf9eefa9bc2", "ja": "そうだな。じゃあ今日は、いい撮影にしないとな！\nみんなにとって、いい思い出になるように。", "zh": "没错。那今天可得拍出一组好照片才行！  \n要让这成为大家美好的回忆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0223_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "170ad7f08bef2c1a4ebc60da6530aa6a36e49d93bbec16e26a923a8e86ebdefe", "ja": "そうですね！\nこの後の撮影でも、イイとこ見せなきゃ♪", "zh": "是啊！\n接下来的拍摄也得好好表现才行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0223_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "60985a9574916309e8f115650668065eb77d16fefb91c6d2df62e0581b2dcc06", "ja": "よーし！　ジャンジャンバリバリ頑張るぞ～！\nそれじゃ{$P$}、行ってきまーす！", "zh": "好——嘞！我要拼尽全力大干一场啦～！\n那我这就去拍摄了，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
